+// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ token sites
+// ACC-GRAPHITE pass 7 (PROPOSED into the chair's copy): `census` keys on a SUBJECT class and `tokens`
+// reads stylesheets only, so a custom property PUBLISHED from script, from a `:style` object, a TS
